name: super-ai
description: "Exponential Copy Cascade - Find seeds with Blueprint + Brainstorm + high-value multiplier early for mind-blowing exponential scaling. Simple concept, devastating effect!"
author: pifreak & AI
deck: Anaglyph
stake: White

# ===== THE MECHANIC: EXPONENTIAL COPY CASCADE =====
# Blueprint copies the Joker to its right
# Brainstorm copies ALL Jokers to their right
# When combined: Blueprint copies X, Brainstorm copies Blueprint copying X = exponential scaling!
# Add a high-value multiplier (Cavendish X3 or Baron with Kings) = mind-blowing results
# 
# MOBILE USERS: Use "Copy Seed" button to quickly share amazing finds! 📱✨

Must:
  # Core requirement: Blueprint early (enables copying)
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1,2,3]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 50
  
  # Core requirement: Brainstorm early (exponential copying)
  - joker: Brainstorm
    antes: [1,2,3]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 50

Should:
  # High-value multiplier option 1: Cavendish (X3 Mult, unconditional)
  # When Blueprint copies Cavendish = X3, Brainstorm copies that = X9 Mult!
  - joker: Cavendish
    antes: [1,2,3,4]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 100
  
  # High-value multiplier option 2: Baron (X1.5 Mult per King, multiplicative)
  # With Mime + Red Seal on Kings = exponential scaling
  - joker: Baron
    antes: [1,2,3,4]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 80
  
  # Amplifier: Mime (doubles retrigger effects)
  # Works with Baron's held-in-hand effect + Red Seal = even more exponential!
  - joker: Mime
    antes: [1,2,3,4]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 60
  
  # Synergy booster: Red Seal on Kings (retriggers held-in-hand effects)
  # With Baron + Mime = exponential multiplicative scaling per King!
  # Note: Searching for specific sealed cards is complex, so we'll focus on Baron + Mime combo instead
  # (Red Seal Kings are a nice-to-have bonus that amplifies Baron's effect)
  
  # Alternative high-value: Stuntman (+250 Chips, Blueprint copies chip bonus!)
  - joker: Stuntman
    antes: [1,2,3,4]
    shopItems: [0,1,2,3,4,5]
    score: 70
  
  # Utility: Painted Deck synergy (+2 hand size helps with Baron Kings)
  # Note: This is a deck, not a Joker, so we can't search for it directly
  # But we can note it in the description!
  
  # Bonus: Early Perkeo for consumable slot (can help with planetCard/tarotCard scaling)
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [1,2,3]
    boosterPacks: [0,1]
    score: 30

# ===== SCORING EXPLANATION =====
# Base score: 100 (Blueprint + Brainstorm both found)
# +100 if Cavendish found (X9 Mult potential!)
# +80 if Baron found (exponential with Kings)
# +70 if Stuntman found (massive chip boost)
# +60 if Mime found (doubles retriggers)
# +40 per Red Seal King (exponential Baron scaling)
# +30 if Perkeo found (utility)
# 
# Maximum theoretical score: 100 + 100 + 80 + 70 + 60 + (40 * multiple Kings) + 30
# = 440+ base, plus King bonuses!
#
# THE MIND-BLOWING PART:
# With Blueprint + Brainstorm + Cavendish:
# - Base: X3 Mult from Cavendish
# - Blueprint copies: X3 Mult (total X9)
# - Brainstorm copies Blueprint: X3 Mult again (total X27!)
# Simple 3 Jokers = X27 Mult multiplier. That's the power of exponential copying!
#
# With Blueprint + Brainstorm + Baron + Mime + Red Seal Kings:
# - Baron: X1.5 per King (multiplicative)
# - Mime: Doubles retrigger effects
# - Red Seal: Retriggers held-in-hand effects
# - Blueprint: Copies Baron's effect
# - Brainstorm: Copies Blueprint copying Baron
# Result: Exponential multiplicative scaling that grows with each King held!
#
# MOBILE COPY BUTTON: 📋 Tap to copy seed instantly for sharing! 🚀
